  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5606.09 Audits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5606.09 Audits. Any person that has been authorized to scan, record, retain, or store personal information in any electronic form or format shall be subject to audits by the department.\n\nSource. #7813, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-03",
